{
  "name": "Document Digital Signature Handler",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "request-signature",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": true
        }
      },
      "id": "webhook-doc",
      "name": "Webhook with Doc",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.docusign.com/v2.1/envelopes",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ documents: [{ documentBase64: $binary.data?.base64 || '', name: $json.body.documentName || 'document.pdf', fileExtension: 'pdf', documentId: '1' }], recipients: { signers: [{ email: $json.body.signerEmail, name: $json.body.signerName, recipientId: '1', tabs: { signHereTabs: [{ documentId: '1', pageNumber: '1', xPosition: '100', yPosition: '700' }] } }] }, status: 'sent', emailSubject: 'Please sign: ' + ($json.body.documentName || 'Document') }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "send-esign",
      "name": "HTTP Send for E-Sign",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [460, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "signature-callback",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-callback",
      "name": "Webhook Callback Signed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 520]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upload",
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "name": "=signed_{{ $json.body.documentName || 'document' }}_{{ new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0] }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "drive-save",
      "name": "Drive Save Signed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [460, 520],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "values": {
            "values": [
              { "column": "DocumentName", "value": "={{ $json.body.documentName }}" },
              { "column": "SignerName", "value": "={{ $json.body.signerName }}" },
              { "column": "SignerEmail", "value": "={{ $json.body.signerEmail }}" },
              { "column": "Status", "value": "={{ $json.body.status || 'signed' }}" },
              { "column": "SignedAt", "value": "={{ $json.body.signedAt || new Date().toISOString() }}" },
              { "column": "EnvelopeId", "value": "={{ $json.body.envelopeId }}" }
            ]
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-audit",
      "name": "Sheets Audit Log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [680, 520],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.body.requesterEmail || 'legal@company.com' }}",
        "subject": "=Document Signed: {{ $json.body.documentName }}",
        "message": "=The document has been signed.\n\nDocument: {{ $json.body.documentName }}\nSigner: {{ $json.body.signerName }} ({{ $json.body.signerEmail }})\nSigned at: {{ $json.body.signedAt || new Date().toISOString() }}\nEnvelope ID: {{ $json.body.envelopeId }}\n\nThe signed document has been saved to Google Drive and logged for audit.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gmail-confirm",
      "name": "Gmail Confirmation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [900, 520],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Document Digital Signature Handler\n\nTwo-phase workflow:\n1. **Request:** Webhook receives doc → HTTP sends to e-signature service (DocuSign/etc)\n2. **Callback:** Webhook receives signed status → Drive saves signed doc → Sheets audit → Gmail confirmation\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Configure e-signature API credentials (DocuSign, HelloSign, etc.)\n2. Set callback URL in e-signature service settings\n3. Set Google Drive signed documents folder\n4. Set Sheets audit log\n5. Set Gmail credentials\n6. Phase 1 POST: { documentName, signerEmail, signerName } + binary\n7. Phase 2: Automatic callback from e-signature service"
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 80]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook with Doc": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "HTTP Send for E-Sign", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Webhook Callback Signed": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Drive Save Signed", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Drive Save Signed": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Sheets Audit Log", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Sheets Audit Log": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Gmail Confirmation", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  }
}